{"sourceUrl":"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/2025/0623/c8550a287817/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.258037+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/2025/0623/c8550a287817/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>    南京医科大学公共卫生与预防医学学科在第四轮和第五轮学科评估中蝉联</span><span>A+等级，2</span></span><span>020</span><span><span>年入选教育部首批高层次应用型公共卫生人才创新培养项目，</span><span>2022年入选国家“双一流”建设学科名单。为促进全国优秀大学生深入了解我院公共卫生与预防医学学科特色与科研平台，提升优秀学子对公共卫生事业的兴趣，我院将于</span><span>2</span></span><span>025</span><span><span>年</span><span>7月1</span></span><span>3-14</span><span><span>日</span><span>举行暑期开放日活动，现将相关安排通知如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span>一</span></strong><strong><span>、报名时间</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>2</span><span>025<span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span>25<span>日</span></span><span>1</span><span>0:00-7<span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span></span><span>2</span><span>4</span><span>:00</span></p><p><strong><span>二、计划人数</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>60</span><span>-80</span><span>名左右，最终将根据具体报名情况确定，欢迎对科学研究有浓厚兴趣的优秀学子踊跃报名。</span></p><p><strong><span>三、活动安排</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>相关活动将于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>13-14</span><span>日在南京医科大学江宁校区线下进行，包含学院介绍、专家讲座、平台参观及师生座谈等内容。共计</span></span><span>2<span>天，</span></span><span>具体活动安排将另行通知。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、报名条件</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1<span>．</span></span><span>全国高</span><span>等医（药）院校和综合大学公共卫生与预防医学相关专业的</span><span>2026</span><span>届</span><span>优秀应届</span><span>本科毕业生</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span> </span><span>具有良好的思想品德，身心健康</span><span>，无作弊作假或其他违法违纪受处分记录；</span></p><p><span>3<span>．</span></span><span>对科学研究具有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创新能力和潜能；</span><span> </span></p><p><span>4<span>．在学期间学习成绩优秀，本科总成绩专业排名前</span></span><span>20</span><span>%<span>；英语水平良好，全国大学英语六级成绩</span><span><span>≥</span>450</span><span>分</span></span><span><span>或雅思</span><span>≥</span><span>6.5</span><span>分或托福≥</span><span>80</span><span>分；</span></span></p><p><strong><span>五、报名程序及材料要求</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>．网上报名：</span></strong><span>请上传基本信息至问卷星：</span><span><a href=\"https://www.wjx.cn/vm/w4SUPhj.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.wjx.cn/vm/w4SUPhj.aspx</a></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/42/85/1bf190f54dceae8eb4df77b025d1/e4290399-6cdc-470c-a909-7891e782dc33.jpg\"/></p><p><span>如实填写个人信息并提交（注意：提交前请务必认真核对，提交后不得再做更改），并同时上传以下材料</span><span>：</span></p><p><span><span>①个人简历（</span><span>1</span></span><span>-2</span><span>页），</span><span><span>模板见附件</span><span>1</span></span><span>；</span></p><p><span>②截至目前的成绩单扫描件（请所在院系教务部门签章并注明专业排名和专业总人数）</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>③</span><span>全国大学英语六级考试成绩单等体现自身英语水平的证明材料扫描件</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>④其它体现综合素质的材料，包括：获奖证书，发表学术论文首页或证明，出版物封面及作者页，课题证明等扫描件</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>⑤</span><span>身份证、学生证扫描件</span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>注：以上</span><span>①</span><span>-</span></span><span>⑤</span><span><span>所提到的材料均需扫描，并按照顺序合成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文档上传。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>         2<strong><span>．</span></strong></span></strong><strong><span>资格审核：</span></strong><span>审核工作于</span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span>4</span><span>日</span><span>截止。其后，我校将根据报名情况和择优原则，确定并公布入选学生名单，请及时查询南京医科大学公共卫生学院官网信息：</span><span>https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/</span><span>。确定参加线下开放日活动的同学须在指定日期前按照短信通知要求确认参加，逾期未确认视为自动放弃此资格。</span></p><p><strong><span>六、注意事项</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>. </span><span>我院将为入选外地学生提供开放日期间在宁的食宿（注：学校或家庭所在地是南京的学生原则上不安排住宿）。往返交通费用需自理。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>．</span><span>请确保填报信息准确无误，</span><span>若有虚假，即取消</span><span>该学生参与资格</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>3. <span>参加暑期开放日的学生必须遵守南京医科大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动，并注意安全。</span></span></p><p><span>4. </span><span>学生</span><span>报到后要求全程参加开放日活动，擅自离</span><span>开</span><span>者，</span><span>学院</span><span>将不提供相关资助。</span></p><p><strong><span>七、联系方式</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>联系人：</span><span>赵</span><span>老师、</span><span>储</span><span>老师</span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span>025-8686841</span><span>2</span></p><p><span>E-mail: gwxkb@njmu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>本《活动通知》自公布之日起实施，未列事项参照学校相关规定执行，由公共卫生学院负责解释。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>附件</span><span>1.</span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/42/85/1bf190f54dceae8eb4df77b025d1/c15f393e-5fcf-431f-a5d7-6ba59cb30505.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">简历模板（供参考）.docx</a></span></span></p><p><span><span>附件</span><span>2.</span><span></span><a href=\"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/42/85/1bf190f54dceae8eb4df77b025d1/6bdc373c-c761-4916-b761-f427dc63b98f.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/42/85/1bf190f54dceae8eb4df77b025d1/a3d25230-80f1-4849-b00e-6622e096d203.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/></a><a href=\"https://gwxy.njmu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/42/85/1bf190f54dceae8eb4df77b025d1/b945b1dd-a24f-427d-9343-0993757599d2.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">南京医科大学公共卫生学院2025年暑期开放日活动申请表.docx</a><span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"1be26fbcdc38764c8a7b46c73b122152d1cf02ad687d9d5b4b42a4898734e8e7","textLength":1304,"sourceSha256":"8772ee95e52c93a1983cbf6c911757bcee2818db50986a98616b345b039066fd","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5d77138dd1a00bf49ac4","title":"2025年南京医科大学公共卫生学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期开放日活动报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.258037+00:00"}
